      414.76,
      549.83,
      452.23
    ],
    "text": "1. Corporate Income Tax exemptions specified in Column (V) of the Table above, shall apply to all gains and profits of a Strategic Development Project, as determined in accordance with the Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of 2017, and such exemption shall commence from the date of commencement of commercial operations;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.3,
      462.76,
      549.82,
      524.23
    ],
    "text": "2. CID - Customs Import Duty imposed under the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235) VAT - Value Added Tax imposed under the Value Added Tax Act, No 14 of 2002 PAL - Ports and Airports Development Levy imposed under the Ports and Airports Development Levy Act, No 18 of 2011 CESS -A cess imposed under the Sri Lanka Export Development Act, No. 40 of 1979.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.28,
      534.76,
      549.82,
      584.23
    ],
    "text": "3. Importation of motor vehicles intended for travelling or personal use shall not be exempted under Column (VI) of the Table given above.4. The project shall be liable to pay taxes in terms of the provisions of the relevant laws for the time being in force, after the expiry of the tax exemption period.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.28,
      594.76,
      549.8,
      632.23
    ],
    "text": "5. Project Implementation period shall be the period commencing from the date as stipulated in the agreement entered with the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka and the enterprise and ending on the date of the commencement of commercial operations as certified by the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka.",
